<title>USA: New Plan Realty increases qtly div.</title>
<headline>New Plan Realty increases qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Plan Realty Trust said Monday it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.3625 per share from $0.36 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable July 8 to shareholders of record on June 20.</p>
</text>
